1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
I was at the feast, St. Elzear's.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:06,670
The thing for us kids was to blow powdered sugar

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,230
on each other from the zeppoles.

4
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:15,220
Thousands of people either praying or eating.

5
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,370
Anyway, my sister was on this ride

6
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:23,740
with my niece when it lurched forward

7
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:26,160
pretty bad. God.

8
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:26,930
He wasn't there, just Elzear.

9
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,780
But he was so busy getting money pinned to his ass

10
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:33,170
that he got distracted and a bolt snapped.

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,980
Were they hurt?

12
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:38,840
You look around, all these people are lined up for this shit.

13
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:41,720
The kids, adults, families.

14
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:42,790
Rides.

15
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,510
Yeah, they pay money so they can almost puke.

16
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,560
They scream, they yell.

17
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,500
Why do you think that is?

18
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:51,890
They're bored.

19
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,510
Are you bored?

20
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:05,610
Am I bored?

21
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:10,860
I got shot in the pancreas and I recovered.

22
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:12,540
No brain damage from the septic shock,

23
00:01:12,070 --> 00:01:14,320
like everybody figured I'd have.

24
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:18,210
You know my feelings. Every day is a gift.

25
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,850
It's just...

26
00:01:22,630 --> 00:01:24,640
does it have to be a pair of socks?

27
00:01:29,050 --> 00:01:30,170
I'm joking.

28
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,240
I'm joking.

29
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,600
Well, what are you gonna do?

30
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,770
It's the human condition.

31
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,170
What is?

32
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:53,290
I don't know.

33
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,750
Yeah, this is Peter Gaultieri.

34
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:58,620
I'm calling for the result of my biopsy again.
